  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "heading": "Main article",
      "text": "With more than 3.1 million records and over 160,000 records added every year, Global Health is the only database dedicated to public health. It adds to the picture of international medical and health research by providing unrivalled access to all relevant research and practices in global health around the world.\n\nGlobal Health can be accessed via the Web of Science platform and is integrated in the Web of Science citation network. The database can be accessed via the ETH Zurich network or at the ETH Library.\n\nMore than just data – Benefit from know-how"
    }
